<title>USA: Springs Industries Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Springs Industries Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>FORT MILL, S.C. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.11		    $1.08</p>
<p> Net			 22,617		   21,306</p>
<p> Revs		     569,231		  623,740</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.64		    $2.41</p>
<p> Net			 74,355		   45,566</p>
<p> Revs		   1,697,743		1,639,548</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  20,453		   18,944</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 nine mths net includes an after-tax gain on the sale of a subsidiary, a restructuring charge and other write-offs.  Without these items, net income for the nine months would have been $51.0 million, or $2.49 per share. Nine months 1996 net includes $3,552,000, or $0.17 a share, loss on retirement of debt.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
